      "value": "I saw that this post got marked with the “needs more information” tag so I guess I can try to provide, though I don’t know what information is needed…\n\nLaunch the game, go in game and then change settings for your microphone. \n\nExit the VRChat application and then go back into VRChat. \n\nYou will see that your microphone settings are now changed from what they were from the last time VRChat was opened. \n\nHope this helps.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
